<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18568" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύλ-ακτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unguarded,
				unwatched,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφέντες τὴν ἑωυτῶν ἀφύλακτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.70
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				93
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡ τήρησις</span>
			<i>no</i> watching is <i>sufficient,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				162
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάσσομαι</span>) <i>unguarded, off one's guard,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφυλάκτῳ τινὶ ἐπιπεσεῖν, ἐπιγενέσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ ἀδικεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1372a19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύλακτον εὕδειν
			εὐφρόνην</span> sleep <i>securely</i> through the night,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				337
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινα λαμβάνειν</span> catch
			one <i>off his guard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα . . ἀ. ληφθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>want of precaution,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.30
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.7.4
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος, νυκτὸς ὥρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.1.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.36.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμιλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.30
				</span></i>
			 W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾳθύμως καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.19
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					7.16.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>against which no precautions are</i> or <i>can be used,
				not guarded against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1372a24
			</span></i>; <i>inevitable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πεπρωμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					218.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκωκή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).115.7
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.211
				</span></i>
			 (Stat. Flacc.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				198
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
